{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00265","headline":"秋风函谷应诏 · 徐贤妃","name":"秋风函谷应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风起函谷，劲气动河山。\n偃松千岭上，杂雨二陵间。\n低云愁广隰，落日惨重关。\n此时飘紫气，应验真人还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐贤妃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}